{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54915","headline":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 二十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵发日，前面有羣乌（首本作「声鸣」，兹从辛本、川本、京本）。\n乱叫乱（辛本、川本、京本作「衆」）鸣防伏截，或（京本作「忽」）然有战莫先图，详缓保（京本作「却」）无虞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}